### Third-party materials and data

This repository includes images, data, and other materials owned by third
parties, including Wikimedia Commons contributors, Unsplash contributors,
the Geospatial Information Authority of Japan, and Open-Meteo data providers.
Those materials are excluded from this license and remain subject to their
respective source licenses and terms. This license does not claim that
Tomoyuki Shidara owns their copyrights, nor does it impose the restrictions
above on those third-party materials.

See `docs/image-provenance.csv` and the in-app Credits & Sources screen for
image authors, source information, and licenses. Weather and marine data in
`docs/weather/` are derived from Open-Meteo data and remain subject to the
applicable service and source-data terms.

